reak to the general public.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"An 'Inform Public' activity must be followed by a 'Monitor Disease Spread' activity at some point later in the same process instance. Conversely, a 'Monitor Disease Spread' event can occur only if an 'Inform Public' event has occurred before it within the same process instance. This bidirectional and ordered dependency ensures that 'Inform Public' imposes obligations for future 'Monitor Disease Spread', and 'Monitor Disease Spread' cannot occur without prior 'Inform Public'. Multiple 'Inform Public' and 'Monitor Disease Spread' are allowed, with each 'Inform Public' eventually leading to a 'Monitor Disease Spread' and each 'Monitor Disease Spread' being justified by a preceding 'Inform Public'.\",\"template\":\"Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Inform Public\",\"description\":\"The 'Inform Public' activity involves communicating relevant information about the outbreak to the general public.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Monitor Disease Spread\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor Disease Spread' activity involves tracking and observing the progression and spread of the disease.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Declare End of Outbreak' must be the last activity to occur in the process.\",\"template\":\"End\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Declare End of Outbreak\",\"description\":\"The 'Declare End of Outbreak' activity involves officially announcing that the outbreak has ended.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Report Disease Outbreak' activity occurs with the activation condition that 'Number of Cases' is greater than 500, then an 'Implement Cont